It is alleged by PW1 in Ex.P1 that on 05.05.2017 at about 12.00 p.m., the accused came to his house while he was away at Thiruvananthapuram; abused his abed parents in filthy and below-belt language;
ransacked the house; pulled out TV Cable connections; disconnected the same and while she was taking away certain things and documents from his wardrobe, his parents attempted to stop her from taking away his belongings; at that time, she inhumanly assaulted her father who is aged about 80 years and suffering from diseased; threw all the belongings of his parents out of the house;
harassed them with a false complaint; she herself called the Police; once again, she came to his house on 06.05.2017; she abused her parents once again demanding them to vacate the house; held out threats to their lives if they failed to do so or call the Police and put them with threat of causing danger to their lives and limbs.

